Description: Supabase Studio self-hosted dashboard (web)
 Built Next.js standalone web application for the Supabase Studio dashboard —
 the admin UI for a self-hosted Supabase stack (table editor, SQL editor, auth
 and user management, storage browser, edge functions, logs and project
 administration).
 The package ships the production web payload under /usr/lib/supabase-studio
 and declares the Node.js and native-library runtime dependencies it requires.
